  s3 --> s0: you press Stop or the Job ends
  s4 --> s1: the run's accept cannot read the story or the run ends
  s4 --> s0: you press Stop
  s4 --> s5: the run starts its next Job
  s5 --> s0: you press Stop
  s3 --> s6: the Job saves its failure line
  s5 --> s7: the Job saves its failure line
  s6 --> s0: you press Stop
  s6 --> s1: the Job ends
  s7 --> s0: you press Stop
  s7 --> s4: the Job ends
  s5 --> s2: the Job ends
